      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BUDGEREE (1) returned a better run last time, finishing in the money (23.15) at this track behind White Hot Dreams in a Grade 5. Has the early speed to land on the pace and can stick on. Can find winning form. VELVET LEGEND (8) has a strong winning strike-rate here with two wins and a placing from three tries. Comes off a (19.40) win last time, scoring by 1.5 lengths in a Grade 5 over 350m at Murray Bridge Straight. Looks a key chance on best figures. DIVERGENCE (2) has struggled for best form recently, last time finishing 4th (20.27) in a TG1-4W at Angle Park. Has won here at this journey. Has never been out of the placings from three starts out of this box. Shapes as one to consider. WYONG GRESHAM (6) with some luck can improve on an unplaced run last time here.",
